CORE
wire_array_2d1.sv
--bound 1
^\[main\.p0\] always main\.arr\[1\]\[1\] == 2'b10: PROVED up to bound 1$
^\[main\.p1\] always main\.arr\[1\]\[1\] == 2'b00: REFUTED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A two-dimensional unpacked array of nets, assigned element-wise in terms of other elements.
